    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Cat Island Petrichor&quot;</strong> is an exploration adventure game where players take on the role of a cat and solve mysteries set on a beautiful cat island in Japan.<br><strong>Welcome to the summer cat island!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/9b61b67b49de7ed7732dc3b789af79cc.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to create a report, a young girl named Makoto visits a certain cat island to unravel the &quot;mysteries hidden on the island.&quot;<br>She begins her full-scale investigation in preparation for the &quot;island festival&quot; that will take place in seven days.<br>Explore facilities such as the once prosperous lighthouse, shrine, and museum, and uncover the hidden mysteries of the island.<br><strong>You are a cat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/2b9d4fd4a54db359e0054d2169f62223.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/80920ba8ffa8e8a6764f4d7f8d7f4224.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will become a white cat living on the cat island and assist Makoto in her investigation of the &quot;mysteries hidden on the island.&quot;<br>Using cat-specific controls, you will help solve various puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The investigation begins! The story of a white cat and a girl.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/57f04f50bf2dc4e5dcffe525c1dc41bc.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/a36468f354ef9e4ebcbb15e0940764e5.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/fe395e1610e56ca51e1efae185a8c04b.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds as you follow Makoto in pursuit of the &quot;hidden mysteries&quot; on the cat island.<br>While delving into the heart of the story, you can freely explore the island, enjoy small puzzles, and interact with the island's residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The island's colorful residents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/47f196e052e1390febbd26d49bdc0fa4.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>Many unique residents live on the cat island.<br>A mother and child running a diner, a shrine maiden, a receptionist at the tourist information center, and other heroines with distinct personalities will assist with the investigation.<br>Additionally, there are scenarios depicting interactions with each heroine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/77ad42387657a6b630a6a91898c46996.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/a0fe8eb880699ac8cceea40e257379e1.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/857af43cc1d69178c39d2cc4ed296423.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/857af43cc1d69178c39d2cc4ed296423.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/c3842cecd1a58eab2b833c9c7beb64c9.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/65faf2f5c1b27b63b630f924acd9841b.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroines' vulnerable moments in front of the cat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/30dda635f89f257f2ce0f71c6c494890.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/dd4f93e4900abed6d8cbccba73a8c636.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While enjoying interactions with the heroines, you can catch glimpses of their vulnerable sides, such as bathing scenes or moments of unguarded charm.<br>Furthermore, progressing with the heroines' scenarios will allow you to obtain more captivating stills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices between the cat and the girl</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/6507c599b53215e2ba0e78a096aa7754.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>The ending of the story is branchable! What exactly are the mysteries of the cat island?<br>The boundary between humans and cats begins to blur...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Volume</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 heroines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 or more scenarios per heroine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >214+ event scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150,000+ total text</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >265+ total voice recording minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spine animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 facial expression variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 pose/costume variations (main characters)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 CGs, 60 including variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 6 to 12 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available languages: Japanese, English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Spanish</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Cat Island Petrichor&quot;</strong> is an exploration adventure game where players take on the role of a cat and solve mysteries set on a beautiful cat island in Japan.<br><strong>Welcome to the summer cat island!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/9b61b67b49de7ed7732dc3b789af79cc.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to create a report, a young girl named Makoto visits a certain cat island to unravel the &quot;mysteries hidden on the island.&quot;<br>She begins her full-scale investigation in preparation for the &quot;island festival&quot; that will take place in seven days.<br>Explore facilities such as the once prosperous lighthouse, shrine, and museum, and uncover the hidden mysteries of the island.<br><strong>You are a cat!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/2b9d4fd4a54db359e0054d2169f62223.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/80920ba8ffa8e8a6764f4d7f8d7f4224.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will become a white cat living on the cat island and assist Makoto in her investigation of the &quot;mysteries hidden on the island.&quot;<br>Using cat-specific controls, you will help solve various puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The investigation begins! The story of a white cat and a girl.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/57f04f50bf2dc4e5dcffe525c1dc41bc.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/a36468f354ef9e4ebcbb15e0940764e5.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/fe395e1610e56ca51e1efae185a8c04b.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds as you follow Makoto in pursuit of the &quot;hidden mysteries&quot; on the cat island.<br>While delving into the heart of the story, you can freely explore the island, enjoy small puzzles, and interact with the island's residents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The island's colorful residents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/47f196e052e1390febbd26d49bdc0fa4.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>Many unique residents live on the cat island.<br>A mother and child running a diner, a shrine maiden, a receptionist at the tourist information center, and other heroines with distinct personalities will assist with the investigation.<br>Additionally, there are scenarios depicting interactions with each heroine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/77ad42387657a6b630a6a91898c46996.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/a0fe8eb880699ac8cceea40e257379e1.avif?t=1752