"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181890/extras/6507c599b53215e2ba0e78a096aa7754.avif?t=1752090176\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>The ending of the story is branchable! What exactly are the mysteries of the cat island?<br>The boundary between humans and cats begins to blur...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Volume</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 heroines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 or more scenarios per heroine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >214+ event scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150,000+ total text</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >265+ total voice recording minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spine animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 facial expression variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 pose/costume variations (main characters)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 CGs, 60 including variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 6 to 12 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available languages: Japanese, English, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Spanish</p></li></ul>",
